{"title":"2020 AIME II","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2020 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AIME\">AIME II</a></b> problems and solutions. The test was offered on June 6, 2020 for students who have took 2020 AIME I and students who were planning to take the cancelled 2020 AIME II on March 19, 2020. The first link will contain the full set of test problems. The rest will contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems\">Entire Test</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2020 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2020 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AIME_II_Problems